# Trims the CLI upload. Only applies to `vercel deploy` from a machine —
# Git-triggered builds clone from GitHub and ignore this file entirely.
#
# Every path here is either source material the build never reads or local
# scratch. Leading slashes anchor to the repo root on purpose: `/Brochures`
# is the .docx/.pdf originals, while the copies the site actually serves
# live at public/brochures and must keep uploading.

# Source material for the brochures, not the served copies.
/Brochures

# Specs and business context — read by humans, never by next build.
/docs

# Local scratch, untracked.
/_to_delete

# Build output and local env. Vercel rebuilds these itself.
.next
node_modules
.env*.local

# Masters for the hero video; public/video holds the encoded copies.
*.mov
